                <pb facs="0845" n="759" xml:id="pg759"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Leishman</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis states that Mr. Leishman has already accomplished much, and instructs
                    to continue to press for settlement of remaining matters, making some one school
                    license a test case.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
